ity. Follow the university’s grounds and facility-use rules and keep activity within the designated area.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-fitness-wellness-equipment-orientation","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"GVSU Fitness & Wellness equipment orientation","title":"Book an equipment orientation","subtitle":"Sunday planning stop · Recreation Center","notes":"Use the Fitness & Wellness page to request help learning the Recreation Center equipment, then schedule around the program’s current availability.","short_summary":"A practical way to make the Recreation Center less intimidating next week.","evidence_claim":"GVSU Fitness & Wellness lists equipment orientations for people seeking help navigating equipment available at the Recreation Center.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/fitness","source_title":"Fitness & Wellness","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-07-23","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Fitness Services is in the Recreation Center at 1 Campus Drive; the page says training services are available by appointment.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
