 first visit.","short_summary":"A supervised indoor recreation option in the Fieldhouse.","evidence_claim":"GVSU’s Climbing Center is located in B170 of the Fieldhouse and offers open climb alongside workshops, classes, clubs, and private events.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/outdoors/climbing-center-44","source_title":"Climbing Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-07-16","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The published fall/winter schedule includes Saturday open climb from 1–5 p.m.; schedules change, so confirm the current page before travel.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-allendale-arboretum","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Allendale Campus Arboretum","title":"Take a daylight arboretum walk","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Allendale Campus","notes":"Walk the campus grounds in daylight and use the arboretum as a slower reset between indoor stops; stay on maintained paths and respect closures.","short_summary":"An outdoor campus walk among a documented tree collection.","evidence_claim":"GVSU reports that its Allendale Campus Arboretum covers seven acres and contains 700 trees representing 200 species or varieties.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/facilitiesservices/allendale/grounds-81.htm","source_title":"Grounds","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor grounds access can be affected by weather, maintenance, and campus operations; follow posted guidance.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-seidman-house-lemmen-library-archives","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Seidman House and Lemmen Library & Archives","title":"Plan a future archives visit at Seidman House","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Great Lakes Academic Buildings Plaza","notes":"Locate Seidman House beside Lake Superior Hall, then email ahead if you want to use archival materials rather than expecting a walk-in research session.","short_summary":"A historic campus house containing special collections and archives.","evidence_claim":"Lemmen Library & Archives is inside Seidman House on the Allendale Campus, east of Lake Superior Hall, and requests on-site research appointments by email.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/library/specialcollections/visiting-48.htm","source_title":"Planning a Visit","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"An on-site research appointment is requested for collections use. Visitors need a temporary permit in non-metered parking areas.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-transformational-link-expressive-activity","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Transformational Link expressive activity space","title":"Check the Transformational Link gathering space","subtitle":"Saturday evening · designated campus public forum","notes":"If a student-organized public gathering is underway, observe or participate respectfully; do not block routes, and check whether the space has been reserved.","short_summary":"A designated outdoor setting for student expression and gathering.","evidence_claim":"GVSU designates the Transformational Link as a location for expressive activity, including student meetings, performances, demonstrations, rallies, and vigils, and states there is no cost for expressive activity there.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/eventservices/public-gathering-spaceexpressive-activity-42.htm","source_title":"Public Gathering Space/Expressive Activity","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A reservation takes precedence over spontaneous activity. Follow the university’s grounds and facility-use rules and keep activity within the designated area.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-fitness-wellness-equipment-orientation","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"GVSU Fitness & Wellness equipment orientation","title":"Book an equipment orientation","subtitle":"Sunday planning stop · Recreation Center","notes":"Use the Fitness & Wellness page to request help learning the Recreation Center equipment, then schedule around the program’s current availability.","short_summary":"A practical way to make the Recreation Center less intimidating next week.","evidence_claim":"GVSU Fitness & Wellness lists equipment orientations for people seeking help navigating equipment available at the Recreation Center.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/fitness","source_title":"Fitness & Wellness","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-07-23","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Fitness Services is in the Recreation Center at 1 Campus Drive; the page says training services are available by appointment.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
